WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.040
Welcome to our second drink of Goodbye, Toby, part two.
欢迎来到我们对《再见托比》下集的第二杯饮品节目。

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.260
So much happens in this episode.
这一集里发生了太多事。

3
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:09.940
It's like the season four cliffhanger.
就像第四季的悬念一样。

4
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:10.600
Yes.
是的。

5
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.060
And while we did our best to cover everything,
虽然我们已经尽力涵盖了所有内容，

6
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.780
some of you wrote in with story moments
但你们中有些人写信提到了

7
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.300
that you wished we had covered.
一些希望我们能聊到的剧情时刻。

8
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.480
Like Jory L wrote in to say,
比如网友Jory L来信说，

9
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.040
I'm kind of sad they didn't mention the voicemail
我有点难过他们没有提到

10
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.120
Jim left Ryan.
吉姆留给瑞安的那个语音留言。

11
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.540
It was so funny.
真的太搞笑了。

12
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.360
Oh my God, it is so funny.
哦天哪，真的超级搞笑。

13
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.860
Okay, so it's right after Ryan gets arrested
好的，那是在瑞安被捕之后发生的事

14
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.940
and it's a major Jim sass.
充满了吉姆式的尖酸调侃。

15
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.620
Well, I think we need to hear it.
我觉得我们得听听看。

16
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.980
Hey, Ryan, it's Jim.
嘿，瑞安，我是吉姆。

17
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:34.900
You know what?
你知道吗？

18
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.980
Totally disregard that last voicemail
完全不用理会刚才那条语音留言

19
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.020
because you obviously have your hands tied.
因为你现在显然腾不出手来。

20
00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:40.560
Good luck.
祝你好运。

21
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:41.740
Get it?
听懂了吗？

22
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:42.660
He has his hands tied.
他被铐住了手。

23
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.000
Right, not hands full.
对，不是手头正忙。

24
00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:46.220
Yeah, because he's just been cuffed.
对啊，因为他刚刚被戴上手铐。

25
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:46.600
Right.
没错。

26
00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.640
Jim sass.
吉姆的毒舌。

27
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.880
All right, I wanted to share something fun
好了，我想分享一个有趣的东西

28
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.660
that I found on disc four from season nine.
是我在第九季第四张光盘上发现的。

29
00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:57.240
It's in that section called A Look Back.
在那个叫《回顾》的板块里。

30
00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.200
It's like a compilation.
有点像个剪辑合集。

31
00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.160
It's a tearjerker when you watch it.
看的时候真的很催泪。

32
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.160
We've talked about it.
我们聊过这个。

33
00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.500
In the finale episode.
在大结局那一集里。

34
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.260
But there was a moment where Ed Helms
但里面有一个片段是埃德·赫尔姆斯

35
00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.940
talks about the proposal scene
谈到了安迪和安吉拉之间的

36
00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:08.780
between Andy and Angela.
求婚场景。

37
00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.480
Oh, that happens in this episode.
哦，那正好发生在这一集里。

38
00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:11.760
That happens in this episode.
那正好发生在这一集里。

39
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.840
Again, I'm hugely pregnant.
话说回来，我当时怀孕挺着大肚子。

40
00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:14.840
They're trying to hide it.
他们一直在极力掩盖。

41
00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:17.340
But here's some of Ed's memories of that moment.
不过这里有埃德对那个时刻的一些回忆。

42
00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:22.320
I think the scene where Andy proposed to Angela
我觉得安迪向安吉拉求婚的那个场景

43
00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:30.140
Angela was very fitting because it was so left-footed and just awkward.
安吉拉的反应非常贴切，因为它显得那么出其不意又尴尬。

44
00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.540
Angela's response was not good.
安吉拉的反应可真不怎么样。

45
00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:37.320
It really summed up the tension, the misunderstanding, the denial,
它真的总结了那种紧张感、误解、否认，

46
00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:41.420
all these awful things that kind of underpinned their relationship.
所有这些支撑着他们关系的糟糕情绪。

47
00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:42.600
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

48
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.320
All true.
完全正确。

49
00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.560
That response was horrible.
那个反应简直糟糕透顶。

50
00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:50.300
Like, when you married, you're just like, okay, sure.
就好像，当你们结婚时，你只会觉得，好吧，行吧。

51
00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:51.200
I know.
我知道。

52
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:54.420
Well, listen, we also got a fan mail flurry for this episode.
好了，听着，我们这集还收到了雪片般飞来的粉丝信件。

53
00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.820
Folks, really needed me to know that the Dan Band is not in the movie The Wedding Singer.
各位，大家真的很急着让我知道丹乐团并没有参演电影《婚礼歌手》。

54
00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.820
I said they were in The Wedding Singer.
我说过他们演过《婚礼歌手》。

55
00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.620
They were, in fact, in The Hangover and Old School.
事实上，他们演的是《宿醉》和《校园风云》。

56
00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.020
Thank you so much.
非常感谢大家。

57
00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.160
I think I was thinking of Old School.
我想我当时是把《校园风云》记混了。

58
00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:10.860
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

59
00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.740
But I also just recently re-watched The Hangover,
但我最近又重温了一遍《宿醉》，

60
00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.600
and they are also in that.
他们也确实演了那部。

61
00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:17.080
Yeah.
是的。

62
00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:20.420
Which, by the way, The Hangover is a bonkers movie.
顺便说一句，《宿醉》真是一部疯狂的电影。

63
00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:21.260
Bonkers.
太疯狂了。

64
00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.300
How much can happen to those group of guys?
这群家伙怎么能经历那么多事？

65
00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:23.940
My God.
天哪。

66
00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:24.700
So much.
太多了。

67
00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:25.260
So funny.
太好笑了。

68
00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.300
All those guys are so funny.
这里面所有人都有趣极了。

69
00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.880
Ed is so funny in it.
埃德在里面的表现太逗了。

70
00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.160
Ed is amazing in it.
埃德在里面的表演简直绝了。

71
00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:34.760
But lastly, a lot of you wrote in about how much you loved the alt-Michael-Goodbye-Toby songs
但最后，很多人写信来谈到你们有多喜欢迈克尔对托比说再见的那些备选歌曲，

72
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:35.780
that Paul Lieberstein wrote.
也就是保罗·利伯斯坦写的那些歌。

73
00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:40.460
Jenna, you had shared this with us, and we actually had Josh, my husband,
珍娜，你曾把这个分享给我们，我们甚至还让我的丈夫乔希

74
00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.100
sing Beers in Heaven, and Jordan Duffy sing Totally Clips of the Fart.
唱了《天堂里的啤酒》，让乔丹·达菲唱了《放屁的精彩剪辑》。

75
00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:45.640
Yes.
没错。

76
00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:51.220
And we played those in the episode, but we never actually played the song that aired,
我们在节目里播了那些，但实际上从来没播过最终播出那首迈克尔唱给托比的歌。

77
00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:53.540
the one that Michael sings to Toby.
这首歌中间断断续续的，因为有采访插话打断了它，

78
00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.880
It happens and starts and stops because there's talking heads that interrupt it,
但网上一群热心网友把它拼凑在了一起，这样你们就能听完整的一首了。

79
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:02.800
but a bunch of folks online have pieced it all together so you can hear it as one.
是的。

80
00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:03.420
Yes.
这太疯狂了。

81
00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:04.960
It's so crazy.
我都忘了这首歌有多疯狂了。

82
00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:06.960
I forgot how crazy this song is.
这是由兰迪·M 剪辑合成的版本。

83
00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.460
Here's one that was compiled by Randy M.
那是昨天清晨，

84
00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.180
It was early morning yesterday.
天亮前我就醒了。

85
00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.620
I was up before the dawn.
我很享受我的这段时光，

86
00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:22.320
I really have enjoyed my stay.
托比该离开了。

87
00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.280
Toby must be moving on.
我最近终于开始和我的两个孩子从头看《办公室》了。

88
00:03:26.060 --> 00:04:10.200
I just started, finally, watching The Office from the beginning with my two kids.
好吧，我们正看到第三季中期。

89
00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:13.740
Okay, we're in the middle of season three.
我等不及让他们看到那一幕了，因为他们特别喜欢迈克尔有多讨厌托比。

90
00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:20.860
I cannot wait for them to see that because they love how much Michael hates Toby.
我的孩子们当然最喜欢德怀特。

91
00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.720
My kids, of course, love Dwight.
我儿子笑得前仰后合。

92
00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:27.700
My son laughed so hard.
你知道在《冲突解决》那一集里，当迈克尔宣读德怀特的那些投诉时，

93
00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:33.380
You know when conflict resolution, when Michael's reading off all of Dwight's complaints,
其中有一条是，比如，我用电话砸了自己的头，

94
00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:38.180
and the thing about, like, I hit myself in the head with the phone,
迈克尔就问，这怎么能怪到吉姆头上？

95
00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:41.480
and Michael's like, how would that have been Jim's fault?
然后吉姆解释了那件事。

96
00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:42.540
And then Jim explains the thing.
解释了硬币和加重耳机的事。

97
00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.400
Explains the coins, the weighted headset.
这把我儿子笑得倒在地上起不来，那也是我最喜欢的恶作剧。

98
00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:48.900
That put my son on the floor, and that is my favorite prank.
所以现在和他们一起分享真的很开心，我迫不及待想让他们看到这一幕。

99
00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:54.700
So it's so fun to share it with them now, and I cannot wait for them to see this scene.
我都忘了史蒂夫加了多少即兴的小俏皮话进去。

100
00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:59.060
I forgot how many little extra, like, quips that Steve threw in.
我都忘了史蒂夫加了多少即兴的小俏皮话进去。

101
00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:00.060
Like, see ya!
就这样吧，再见！

102
00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.160
Yeah, exactly.
对，没错。

103
00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:02.460
He's out of here!
他这下走人了！

104
00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.680
Like, at the end.
差不多，就在最后。

105
00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:04.880
It's great.
太棒了。

106
00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:09.700
All right, everyone, here is your second drink of Goodbye, Toby, part two.
好了，各位，这是你们的第二杯“再见，托比”第二部分饮品。

107
00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.420
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍。

108
00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.720
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金西。

109
00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.000
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

110
00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.240
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

111
00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:23.080
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在，我们专为你制作了《办公室》终极重温播客。

112
00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:27.800
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享独家幕后故事

113
00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.060
that only two people who were there can tell you.
只有两个身临其境的人才能告诉你这些。

114
00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.180
We're The Office ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

115
00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:38.040
All right, everybody, we are still saying goodbye to Toby.
好了，各位，我们还在向托比道别。

116
00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.160
It is Goodbye, Toby, part two.
这就是《再见，托比》第二部分。

117
00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.100
It's a long goodbye, but he deserves it.
这是一场漫长的告别，但他当之无愧。

118
00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.700
He's been at the company a long time.
他在公司呆了很长时间。

119
00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:46.980
He deserves a two-parter.
他值得拥有一场分两集的告别。

120
00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:49.500
Michael's gonna give him a big send-off, lady.
迈克尔要给他办一场盛大的欢送会呢，女士。

121
00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:50.700
He sure is.
他确实会的。

122
00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:57.660
Guys, it's season four, episode 19, written by Jen Salata and Paul Lieberstein, directed
伙计们，这是第四季第19集，由珍·萨拉塔和保罗·利伯斯坦编剧

123
00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.060
by Paul Feig.
由保罗·费格执导。

124
00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:02.960
Here is a summary of part two of Goodbye, Toby.
以下是《再见，托比》第二部分的剧情梗概。

125
00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:03.760
Okay.
好的。

126
00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:10.500
An extravagant goodbye party is being thrown in the parking lot for Toby.
停车场正在为托比举办一场盛大的告别派对。

127
00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.380
Ryan is arrested for fraud.
瑞安因欺诈被捕。

128
00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:16.380
Michael discovers big news about Jan.
迈克尔发现了关于简的重大消息。

129
00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:24.080
Jim plans to propose to Pam, but gets upstaged by Andy, and Phyllis discovers a secret.
吉姆计划向帕姆求婚，却被安迪抢了风头，菲利斯发现了一个秘密。

130
00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.840
Does she ever?
她可不就是吗？

131
00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:29.420
All right.
好的。

132
00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:30.600
Jumping right in.
马上切入正题。

133
00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.060
Fast fact number one.
速查事实一号。

134
00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.280
I'm calling this party time.
我把这部分叫作派对时间。

135
00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.160
Are you gonna give me a breakdown of all the party?
你要给我详细讲讲整个派对吗？

136
00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.700
You know I am.
你知道我会的。

137
00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:43.220
We got fan questions from Abby M and Yvette M.
我们收到了来自艾比·M和伊薇特·M的粉丝提问。

138
00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:47.440
How many days did it take to film Toby's goodbye party?
托比的告别派对拍了几天？

139
00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.860
How long did it take to set it up?
布置它花多长时间？

140
00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.100
Well, you know I went to Kentopedia.
嗯，你知道我去查了肯托百科。

141
00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:58.700
He said it took one full day to set it up and two days and nights to film.
他说布置花了一整天，拍摄用了两天两夜。

142
00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:03.960
We filmed April 17th and 18th of 2008.
我们于2008年4月17日和18日进行了拍摄。

143
00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:09.140
The Ferris wheel came from a company called Awesome Events,
摩天轮来自一家名为“精彩活动”的公司，

144
00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:14.840
and it cost us $7,500 to rent that Ferris wheel for three days.
我们租用那个摩天轮三天花了两千五百美元。

145
00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:15.940
Dang.
哇塞。

146
00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:16.840
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

147
00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.180
That's a pricey Ferris wheel.
那可真是个昂贵的摩天轮。

148
00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:22.180
Here's what I remember about those party scenes, Angela.
安吉拉，关于那些派对场景我记得这些。

149
00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:26.860
It was very hot during the day, and then at night it got cold.
白天非常热，到了晚上又变冷了。

150
00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:27.480
Yeah.
对。

151
00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:30.920
I remember I had hand warmers in my pockets at night,
我记得我晚上口袋里装着暖手宝，

152
00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:35.920
and you know when you go skiing and you put those toe warmers in your ski boots?
而且你知道滑雪时那种把暖脚贴放进滑雪靴里的感觉吗？

153
00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:38.980
I had those in my shoes for the night shoot.
我夜间拍摄时就在鞋子里放了那个。

154
00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:42.940
Also, whenever they didn't see our feet, we had Uggs on,
另外，只要拍不到我们的脚，我们就穿着Ugg雪地靴，

155
00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:47.140
and Jenna, I have an Ugg catch later in this episode.
而且珍娜，这集后面我会抓到一个穿Ugg的穿帮镜头。

156
00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.920
