好了，现在事情不像迈克尔计划的那样发展了。

315
00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:45.110
He gets out his note cards.
他掏出了他的记事卡。

316
00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.350
He's written some questions.
他写了一些问题。

317
00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:51.650
Again, Steve Carell should have won 15 Emmys.
话说回来，史蒂夫·卡瑞尔真该拿15个艾美奖。

318
00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:52.530
I mean, come on.
我是说，拜托。

319
00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:52.950
Yeah.
对。

320
00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:59.630
This is his having all this stuff he wanted to just tee off on Toby about and now having
他本来攒了一肚子话想借此机会好好数落托比一番，现在却

321
00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:04.690
to dial it back and somehow be acceptable in front of this woman he's falling in love with.
不得不收敛一点，在这个让他心动的女人面前表现得体。

322
00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.950
Every moment, Steve crushes.
每一个瞬间，史蒂夫都演得太棒了。

323
00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:12.430
His first question is, who do you think you are?
他的第一个问题是，你以为你是谁？

324
00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.290
And Toby goes, I'm Toby.
然后托比说，我是托比。

325
00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.950
Now, I hope you noticed in the background, I'm going to toot my own horn.
现在，我希望你们注意到背景里，我要自吹自擂一下了。

326
00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.690
I am taking notes.
我在记笔记呢。

327
00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:24.670
No, I know.
不，我知道。

328
00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:26.910
I watched you write it all down.
我看着你把它们全记下来了。

329
00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:31.090
And I am actually writing down, who are you?
而且我真的在记，你是谁？

330
00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:32.870
And then I wrote down Toby.
然后我写下了托比。

331
00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:36.510
And a couple times I wrote down, he is Toby.
好几次我还写了，他是托比。

332
00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.890
But my whole backstory, and Angela, I loved doing these scenes.
但我的整个背景故事是，安吉拉，我很喜欢拍这些戏。

333
00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:45.770
I loved every time Pam's sole purpose in a scene was to take notes.
我喜欢帕姆在戏里唯一的目的就是记笔记的每一个时刻。

334
00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.490
Because I was just an audience member.
因为我当时就像个观众。

335
00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:48.730
I got to just sit there.
我只需要坐在那儿。

336
00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.770
I didn't have any like real lines I had to say or anything I had to do.
我没有什么必须说的台词，也没有什么必须做的事。

337
00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.910
You just had to try not to laugh.
你只需要努力憋笑就行了。

338
00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:54.770
Pretty much.
差不多吧。

339
00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.330
But I always took diligent notes.
但我总是很认真地做笔记。

340
00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.630
I really did.
我真的有。

341
00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:04.130
Because I liked to pretend that Michael would ask me to transcribe these meetings later.
因为我喜欢假装迈克尔稍后会让我把这些会议记录誊写出来。

342
00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:08.170
I like to think he made you go in his office and read the whole thing back to him.
我觉得他会让你去他办公室，把整篇记录给他念一遍。

343
00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.910
Just so he could feel important.
纯粹是为了让他自己感觉很重要。

344
00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:15.050
This was like something he saw in an old movie once that secretaries do for their bosses.
这就像是他在某部老电影里看到过秘书为老板做的那种事。

345
00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:15.910
That's right.
没错。

346
00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:19.630
His second note card says, what gives you the right?
他的第二张记事卡上写着，谁给你的权力？

347
00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.510
And this is when Holly steps in.
而这时霍莉插话了。

348
00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.230
She's like, you know what?
她说，你知道吗？

349
00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:25.030
I brought the binder.
我把文件夹带过来了。

350
00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:26.770
Do you want to use it?
你想用它吗？

351
00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:27.730
Take a look at it?
看一看这个？

352
00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:28.450
Yeah.
对。

353
00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:34.750
And Michael starts to ask Toby if he has any suggestions on ways that, you know, Dunder Mifflin
然后迈克尔开始问托比，他有没有什么建议，就是你知道的，邓德米夫林

354
00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:35.670
could improve itself.
可以做哪些改进。

355
00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:42.950
And Toby seems like he's going to answer this question until, oh my God, Steve puts his hands
托比本来好像要回答这个问题，直到，天哪，史蒂夫把双手

356
00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:46.210
up to his face to shield himself from Holly.
举到脸前，挡住不让霍莉看见。

357
00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:48.830
And he gives Toby this look.
然后他给了托比那样一个眼神。

358
00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:49.850
It's so good.
太棒了。

359
00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:53.350
He actually mouths the words, I'll kill you.
他其实用嘴型说了句“我要杀了你”。

360
00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:57.430
I missed it.
我没看到。

361
00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:59.370
He says, I'll kill you.
他说，“我要杀了你”。

362
00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:05.230
And in the script, it's written that he does the slit the throat, you know, the finger across
剧本里写的是他做了个抹脖子的动作，你知道的，手指划过

363
00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.210
the throat gesture.
喉咙的手势。

364
00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:06.710
Yeah.
对。

365
00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:09.270
But I don't know if this was Steve improvising.
但我不知道这算不算史蒂夫即兴发挥。

366
00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:11.630
I feel like he probably gave them a few different choices.
我觉得他大概提供了好几种不同的选择。

367
00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.570
But the one they picked was him whispering.
但他们最后选的是他耳语的那种。

368
00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:18.540
It's so amazing.
太精彩了。

369
00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:22.040
And Toby just goes, I guess everything's okay.
而托比只是说，“我想一切都好吧”。

370
00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:23.100
Yeah.
对。

371
00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:27.740
And he's like, you know, he has this moment where he's like, I mean, I made it this far.
然后他就，你知道的，他有那么一刻觉得，我的意思是，我都走到这一步了。

372
00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:28.440
Why not?
为什么不呢？

373
00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:31.400
Well, Pam is going to suggest that Toby open his gift.
好吧，帕姆打算建议托比打开他的礼物。

374
00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.500
Toby, open it.
托比，打开它。

375
00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:33.320
What is it?
是什么？

376
00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.760
And Michael's like, no, no, no, no, no.
然后迈克尔说，不，不，不，不，不。

377
00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.280
You know what?
你知道吗？

378
00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:43.300
You guys, it's a rock with a note on it that says, suck on this.
伙计们，这是一块石头，上面贴了张纸条写着“吃屎吧”。

379
00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.360
I watched this episode with Lee.
我和李一起看了这一集。

380
00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:49.240
Lee, he laughed so hard at this joke.
李，他被这个笑话逗得哈哈大笑。

381
00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.420
He couldn't stop laughing that it was a rock.
他笑得停不下来，居然是一块石头。

382
00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.160
He just thought that was so funny.
他就是觉得这太搞笑了。

383
00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:58.300
Michael, you know, acts like he had no idea.
迈克尔，你知道的，假装他完全不知情。

384
00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:01.040
And he's like, who pulled this prank on Toby?
然后他说，“是谁对托比搞的这个恶作剧？”

385
00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:01.800
This is horrible.
这太恶劣了。

386
00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:03.520
And Dwight's like, you told me to do it.
德鲁伊说，“是你叫我这么做的”。

387
00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.120
And he's like, shh.
然后他说，“嘘”。

388
00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.440
And then he goes, you know what this was?
接着他说，“你知道这是什么吗？”

389
00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:10.880
It was a psych, psych, psyched you out because there's a real gift coming.
这是一个，骗你，骗，骗了你，因为真正的礼物马上就到。

390
00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:16.640
And this is my second favorite thing to do as Pam after taking notes in a meeting, which
这是我作为帕姆在会议上记笔记之后第二喜欢做的事，那就是

391
00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.880
is painting Michael into a corner.
把迈克尔逼进死胡同。

392
00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:22.200
And she says, what's the gift, Michael?
然后她说，“礼物是什么，迈克尔？”

393
00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.520
What is it?
是什么？

394
00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:26.000
Oh, is it your watch?
哦，是你的手表吗？

395
00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:29.000
And he's like, it is.
然后他说，是的。

396
00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.000
It is my watch.
就是我的手表。

397
00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:30.760
How did you know?
你怎么知道的？

398
00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.520
And she says, I just knew.
然后她说，我就是知道。

399
00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:34.300
He's so ticked off.
他气坏了。

400
00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:36.480
He has to give Toby his watch.
他不得不把自己的手表送给托比。

401
00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:37.340
You know what?
你知道吗？

402
00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.460
That's a genuine Seiko piece.
那是正品的精工表。

403
00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.280
He's going to have to give Toby the certificate that's framed as well, I guess.
我想他也得把那个裱起来的证书给托比吧。

404
00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:44.380
I guess he will.
我想他会的。

405
00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:49.440
This delightful scene is interrupted by some hubbub in the bullpen.
这个欢乐的场面被开放办公区的一阵喧闹打断了。

406
00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:53.960
Everyone is gathered around Jim's computer watching a YouTube video.
大家都围在吉姆的电脑前看YouTube视频。

407
00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:54.880
Yeah.
是啊。

408
00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.740
Ryan is being arrested.
瑞安被捕了。

409
00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.140
And someone has uploaded the moment.
而且有人把这一幕上传了。

410
00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.980
And they're all watching it.
大家都在看。

411
00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:05.800
I want you guys to know that they actually put that video on YouTube.
我想让你们知道，他们其实把那个视频放到了YouTube上。

412
00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.160
It was a private account.
那是个私密账号。

413
00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:11.500
So John is actually watching it during that scene.
所以约翰在那个场景里其实是在看它。

414
00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:12.340
We all are.
我们都在看。

415
00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:13.940
But it was a private account.
但那是个私密账号。

416
00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:19.720
When the episode aired, they made the video go live on YouTube so everyone could watch it.
当这集播出时，他们把那个视频设为了公开，这样所有人都能看。

417
00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:20.960
Oh, that's so great.
噢，太棒了。

418
00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.100
I didn't know that.
我以前不知道。

419
00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:22.620
Yeah.
是啊。

420
00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.400
But Michael is very upset.
但迈克尔非常难过。

421
00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.000
He's in his office.
他在自己的办公室里。

422
00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:30.420
And Holly is saying to Toby, what do you do in this situation?
霍莉对托比说，这种情况下你该怎么办？

423
00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.100
Toby says, I don't do anything.
托比说，我什么也不做。

424
00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:33.400
Just leave it alone.
别管它就行。

425
00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:35.480
But Holly is amazing.
但霍莉太棒了。

426
00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.860
She goes into Michael's office and she really comforts him.
她走进迈克尔的办公室，好好地安慰了他。

427
00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:39.860
Michael is crying.
迈克尔在哭。

428
00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.140
He's really sweet.
他真的很温柔。

429
00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:43.020
He says, I'm worried about my friend.
他说，我为我的朋友感到担心。

430
00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:43.780
Yeah.
是啊。

431
00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.200
And she says, that's normal.
她说，这很正常。

432
00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.900
You take the time you need to have your feelings.
你可以花点时间去感受你的情绪。

433
00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:52.800
Which leads to just a wonderful talking head, Angela, that I love.
这就引出了一段绝佳的访谈，安吉拉，我超喜欢。

434
00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:57.260
Where Michael says, Holly is sweet and simple like a lady baker.
迈克尔在里面说，霍莉甜美而单纯，就像个做点心的女士。

435
00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:03.040
And he just wouldn't be surprised to find out that she'd worked in a bakery before coming to Dunder Mifflin.
而且他一点也不会惊讶，如果发现她来邓德米夫林之前在面包房工作过的话。

436
00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:06.380
I mean, he's pretty sure she's baked on a professional level.
我是说，他很确定她达到过专业水平的面包师水平。

437
00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.760
Because baking is love, right?
因为烘焙就是爱，对吧？

438
00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:09.420
Yeah.
对。

439
00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.180
Only sweet ladies bake.
只有温柔的女士才会烘焙。

440
00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:13.100
Sweet ladies who take care of you.
会照顾你的温柔女士。

441
00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:13.820
Yeah.
是啊。

442
00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:14.720
Aw.
噢。

443
00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:22.140
Well, after this very sweet Michael talking head, we are all going to go out in the parking lot because the party is starting.
嗯，在这个非常温馨的迈克尔访谈之后，我们都要去停车场了，因为派对要开始了。

444
00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.080
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

445
00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:27.940
But before we get into that parking lot, Jenna, I need to share a little back story.
但在我们去那个停车场之前，珍娜，我得分享一点背景故事。

446
00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:29.140
Okay.
好啊。

447
00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:37.360
Have you ever been on the phone with someone and you actually hear that person go into a full flop sweat?
你有没有和别人通过电话，然后你真的能听到对方急得直冒大汗？

448
00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.180
Where is this going?
这对话要走向何方？

449
00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.080
Because I have.
因为我遇到过。

450
00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:41.880
Okay.
好盘算。

451
00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:42.920
I have.
我确实有。

452
00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.820
And that person was Kent Zabornak.
而那个人就是肯特·扎博纳克。

453
00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:45.760
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

454
00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:46.820
Oh, gosh.
哦，天哪。

455
00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:51.720
Not only did I remember this, but then I found some emails between Kent and I that really painted the picture.
我不但记起了这件事，后来还找到了我和肯特之间的一些邮件，真的把当时的情景还原了。

456
00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:56.220
And I wanted to share the story with you guys that I almost didn't make it to the parking lot.
我想和大家分享一个故事，我差点连停车场都没能去成。

457
00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.180
Oh, now I know what you're talking about.
哦，现在我知道你在说什么了。

458
00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:07.500
In my emails, I found that on Thursday, April 10th of 2008, at 4 p.m., I had a routine checkup with my OBGYN.
在我的邮件里，我发现那是2008年4月10日星期四下午4点，我去做了一次妇产科的常规检查。

459
00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.020
I emailed Kent about it.
我给肯特发了邮件。

460
00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.540
He said, no problem, Ange.
他说，没问题，安琪。

461
00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.560
We'll have you wrapped in time to make it to that doctor's appointment.
我们会抓紧收工，让你能赶上去看那个医生的预约。

462
00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:19.740
So, lady, while I was at my doctor's appointment, you know, how they sort of check all your vitals and do everything.
所以，女士们，当我在看医生的时候，你们知道的，他们会检查你所有的生命体征并做各种检查。

463
00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:26.520
And I had had, like, I was feeling like a little bit of cramping, but nothing I was really worried about.
当时我感觉，怎么说呢，觉得有点轻微痉挛，但我并没有真正担心。

464
00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:30.060
And she was like, Angela, you're having contractions.
然后她说，安琪拉，你在宫缩。

465
00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:31.300
And I said, what?
我说，什么？

466
00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:32.620
And she said, yeah.
她说，是的。

467
00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.580
And she immediately sent me to the hospital.
她立刻把我送去了医院。

468
00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.140
From your doctor's appointment.
从医生的诊所直接去。

469
00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:39.420
From my doctor's appointment at 4 o'clock.
从我4点钟的医生预约直接去。

470
00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.520
Now I'm in the hospital.
现在我在医院了。

471
00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:43.340
I'm having contractions every five minutes.
我每五分钟宫缩一次。

472
00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:51.400
And around 6 o'clock in the evening, Jenny O'Keefe, who was our second AD, called me to tell me my call time.
大约在晚上6点，我们的第二副导演珍妮·基夫打电话给我，告诉我我的通告时间。

473
00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:51.880
Right?
对吧？

474
00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:53.180
For the next day.
第二天的。

475
00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:53.880
For the next day.
第二天的。

476
00:21:53.980 --> 00:21:54.780
She's like, hi, Angela.
她说，嗨，安琪拉。

477
00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:56.680
Your call time tomorrow is 5.30 a.m.
你明天的通告时间是早上5点半。

478
00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:58.320
And I said, Jenny, I'm in the hospital.
我说，珍妮，我在医院呢。

479
00:21:59.020 --> 00:21:59.960
She said, what?
她说，什么？

480
00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:02.420
And I said, I'm having contractions.
我说，我在宫缩。

481
00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:03.260
And she goes, okay.
然后她说，好吧。

482
00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:03.920
Okay.
好吧。

483
00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:06.980
I will get back to you.
我再联系你。

484
00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:11.540
Literally three seconds later, my phone rings and it's Kent Sabornak.
真的就三秒钟后，我的电话响了，是肯特·塔博纳克打来的。

485
00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:15.460
And I will never forget the first thing he said to me.
我永远不会忘记他对我说第一句话时的情景。

486
00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.980
He said, hey, hey, Ange.
他说，嘿，嘿，安琪。

487
00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.920
Uh, we having this baby today?
呃，我们今天就要把这孩子生下来吗？

488
00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:23.000
But like his voice cracked and went up.
但他声音都破音了，还提高了调子。

489
00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:24.860
It's like, we having this baby today?
就像是，我们今天就要把这孩子生下来吗？

490
00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:30.080
Because what you guys have to know is they were building a freaking Ferris wheel in the parking lot.
因为你们必须知道的是，他们正在停车场里搭建一个该死的摩天轮。

491
00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:31.080
That's right.
没错。

492
00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:36.920
And to give you guys some context, this was all happening about three weeks before your due date.
为了让大家了解背景，这一切发生在大约离你预产期还有三周的时候。

493
00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:37.400
Right?
对吧？

494
00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:37.760
Yeah.
是的。

495
00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:40.480
We just had a few more days of filming with you.
我们和你只剩下最后几天的拍摄了。

496
00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:47.820
Everyone just assumed that we would finish this episode and then you would go off on your summer hiatus and have your baby.
大家都以为我们会拍完这一集，然后你就会开始你的暑假产假去生孩子。

497
00:22:48.740 --> 00:22:50.220
Kent thought he had time.
肯特以为他还有时间。

498
00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:58.360
But in reality, you are in the hospital and he was probably standing in the parking lot as they're assembling this Ferris wheel and he's freaking out.
但现实是，你在医院里，而他可能正站在停车场看着他们组装这个摩天轮，他快急疯了。

499
00:22:58.880 --> 00:22:59.240
Yeah.
是的。

500
00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:02.700
How does Andy propose if Angela can't be there?
如果安琪拉不在，安迪怎么求婚？

501
00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:03.280
Yeah.
是啊。

502
00:23:03.820 --> 00:23:05.320
In front of the Ferris wheel.
在摩天轮前面。

503
00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:07.560
So I said, Kent, I don't know.
所以我说，肯特，我不知道。

504
00:23:07.660 --> 00:23:09.120
I don't know if I'm having this baby tonight.
我不知道我今晚会不会生下这个孩子。

505
00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:11.600
And he said, well, would you keep me posted?
他说，好吧，随时向我汇报情况好吗？

506
00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:13.020
And I said, sure.
我说，没问题。

507
00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:15.840
And it turned out to be false labor.
结果证明是假临产。

508
00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:17.620
I was there till about two in the morning.
我在那儿待到了凌晨两点左右。

509
00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:20.180
I did have to go work a half day the next day.
第二天我确实还得去上半天班。

510
00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:24.560
And let me tell you, Kent had already hired a stunt woman.
实话告诉你们吧，肯特已经请了一个特技替身。

511
00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:26.200
Her name was Melissa Barker.
她叫梅丽莎·巴克。

512
00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:29.840
And she was to be my body double for the rest of this shoot.
在这次拍摄的剩余时间里，她将担任我的身体替身。

513
00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:35.080
They really wanted to try to make sure I did not have to work if I was not in a speaking scene.
他们真的想确保如果我没有台词镜头，就不用工作。

514
00:23:35.360 --> 00:23:35.480
Right?
对吧？

515
00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:36.660
They would use Melissa.
他们会用梅丽莎。

516
00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:41.020
Angela, it was so weird to have her on set because she was dressed just like you.
安吉拉，片场有她在真是太诡异了，因为她穿得跟你一模一样。

517
00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:42.780
She had her hair done just like you.
她的发型也跟你一模一样。

518
00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:45.480
From behind, she seriously looked like you.
从背影看，她简直就是你。

519
00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:51.800
So, yes, if there was a scene in the conference room and you were just not speaking, she would be sitting there.
所以，是的，如果有一场会议室的戏，而你只是没有台词，她就会坐在那里。

520
00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:53.900
And I would forget that she wasn't you.
而我会忘掉她不是你。

521
00:23:54.520 --> 00:23:54.880
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

522
00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:58.100
Well, listen, this all happened on a Thursday night.
听着，这一切都发生在一个星期四的晚上。

523
00:23:58.360 --> 00:24:01.420
By Saturday, Kent sent the whole cast this email.
到了星期六，肯特给全体演员发了这封电子邮件。

524
00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:03.000
Saturday, April 12th.
4月12日，星期六。

525
00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:06.700
Hey, you guys, our one-liner schedule will be coming out later tomorrow.
嘿，各位，我们的单行日程表明天晚些时候会出来。

526
00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:15.620
Please be advised that we are trying to shoot Miss Angela Kinsey out next week so she can go rest easily for a full week before delivering her little girl.
请注意，我们正争取在下周把安吉拉·金西小姐的戏份拍完，这样她就可以在生下小女儿之前好好休息整整一周。

527
00:24:15.840 --> 00:24:22.440
And to accommodate this, Wednesday through Friday's schedule will be more grueling than normal, especially Friday night's work.
为了配合这一点，周三到周五的日程会比平时更折腾，尤其是周五晚上的工作。

528
00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:24.420
Think Ferris wheel and fireworks.
想想摩天轮和烟花吧。

529
00:24:24.420 --> 00:24:31.580
We will all take extra precautions to ensure Angela is comfortable and that she remains hydrated every single moment she is here.
我们都会采取额外措施，确保安吉拉感到舒适，并在她在这里的每一分每一秒都保持水分充足。

530
00:24:31.720 --> 00:24:34.120
So, prepare for the walkie-talkie chatter.
所以，准备好听对讲机的闲聊吧。

531
00:24:34.460 --> 00:24:36.480
Angela's going 10-1 again.
安吉拉又去上厕所了。

532
00:24:39.540 --> 00:24:42.620
So, yeah, I almost didn't make it to the parking lot.
所以，是的，我差点没走到停车场。

533
00:24:43.300 --> 00:24:44.680
Well, I'm glad you made it.
嗯，我很高兴你成功了。

534
00:24:44.880 --> 00:24:45.720
I am, too.
我也是。

535
00:24:46.540 --> 00:24:49.760
I do remember the whole cast and crew were a little worried.
我确实记得全体演员和工作人员都有点担心。

536
00:24:49.920 --> 00:24:50.460
We were concerned.
我们很担心。

537
00:24:50.460 --> 00:24:53.820
We wanted to make sure that we got your work done firSt.
我们想确保先拍完你的工作。

538
00:24:54.420 --> 00:24:55.520
So, that you could leave.
好让你能离开。

539
00:24:55.780 --> 00:24:56.040
Yes.
是的。

540
00:24:56.120 --> 00:24:58.040
And I left and Melissa Barker stayed.
然后我走了，梅丽莎·巴克留下了。

541
00:24:58.280 --> 00:24:59.700
So, thank you, Melissa Barker.
所以，谢谢你，梅丽莎·巴克。

542
00:25:00.120 --> 00:25:05.080
And, lady, now everyone is exiting the building, going into the parking lot.
好了，女士们，现在所有人都走出大楼，进入停车场。

543
00:25:05.500 --> 00:25:07.600
25 minutes, 52 seconds.
25分52秒。

544
00:25:07.960 --> 00:25:08.720
Ugg alert.
雪地靴警报。

545
00:25:09.400 --> 00:25:10.880
Who has the Uggs?
谁穿着雪地靴？

546
00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:13.840
Who has the warm, fuzzy Uggs on?
谁穿着温暖毛茸茸的雪地靴？

547
00:25:13.960 --> 00:25:15.080
Who is this person?
这人是谁？

548
00:25:15.440 --> 00:25:16.340
It is me.
是我。

549
00:25:18.240 --> 00:25:22.040
And this starts a theme for this episode where they just gave up with me.
这就开启了这一集的一个主题，他们对我彻底放弃了。

550
00:25:22.220 --> 00:25:23.880
They were like, just keep her comfortable.
他们觉得，只要让她舒服就行。

551
00:25:24.420 --> 00:25:30.200
And I feel like in almost every shot, you can see my belly and I'm wearing Uggs and no one cares.
而且我觉得几乎每个镜头里，你都能看到我的肚子，我还穿着雪地靴，但根本没人介意。

552
00:25:30.580 --> 00:25:31.240
You know what?
你知道吗？

553
00:25:31.320 --> 00:25:35.660
I remember watching Seinfeld when Julia Louis-Dreyfus was pregnant.
我记得看《宋飞正传》时，朱莉娅·路易斯-德利法斯正怀着孕。

554
00:25:35.720 --> 00:25:39.200
And there were a few times where I feel like it was the same.
有好几次我都觉得情况是一样的。

555
00:25:39.380 --> 00:25:40.520
They were like, you know what?
他们当时就像是在说，你知道吗？

556
00:25:40.520 --> 00:25:42.040
We all know she's pregnant.
我们都知道她怀孕了。

557
00:25:42.240 --> 00:25:45.220
We're pretending like she's not pregnant because her character's not pregnant.
我们假装她没怀孕，因为她的角色没怀孕。

558
00:25:45.460 --> 00:25:48.020
Let's just, we're all in it together, folks.
大家就这么心照不宣吧，伙计们。

559
00:25:48.020 --> 00:25:48.580
Yeah.
对啊。

560
00:25:48.780 --> 00:25:49.920
We're just giving up.
我们干脆放弃伪装了。

561
00:25:50.620 --> 00:25:51.100
Exactly.
没错。

562
00:25:52.400 --> 00:25:58.640
Well, Michael is very disappointed that there is not an anti-gravity machine, but he is impressed with the Ferris wheel.
迈克尔对没有反重力装置感到很失望，不过他对摩天轮印象深刻。

563
00:25:59.280 --> 00:26:01.120
Yeah, and there's a bouncy house.
对啊，还有一个充气城堡。

564
00:26:01.260 --> 00:26:07.180
Which, by the way, poor Brian, in the heat, had to jump up and down in over and over.
顺便说一句，可怜的布莱恩顶着高温，不得不在里面一次又一次地跳上跳下。

565
00:26:07.240 --> 00:26:08.800
And it was so hot in there.
里面真的太热了。

566
00:26:08.920 --> 00:26:12.220
And there's deleted scenes of him jumping and jumping.
还有被删掉的片段，全是他一直在跳一直跳。

567
00:26:12.400 --> 00:26:14.480
And it didn't even make it in the episode.
结果连正片都没剪进去。

568
00:26:14.800 --> 00:26:15.620
I know.
我知道。

569
00:26:16.160 --> 00:26:23.800
This is also when Pam clocks the fireworks and she realizes, oh my gosh, is Jim going to propose tonight?
这也是潘注意到烟花的时候，她意识到，哦天哪，吉姆今晚要求婚吗？

570
00:26:23.880 --> 00:26:24.980
She's so excited.
她太激动了。

571
00:26:25.320 --> 00:26:27.420
Lady, I thought you were so good in this episode.
天哪，我觉得你这一集里演得太好了。

572
00:26:27.420 --> 00:26:31.500
I thought your performance was so subtle and the emotion was so there.
我觉得你的表演非常细腻，情感也十分到位。

573
00:26:31.780 --> 00:26:33.860
I just thought it was a beautiful, beautiful job.
我真的觉得这是一次非常非常棒的表演。

574
00:26:34.120 --> 00:26:34.700
Oh my gosh.
哦天哪。

575
00:26:34.840 --> 00:26:35.820
Thank you so much.
非常感谢。

576
00:26:36.020 --> 00:26:36.340
Yeah.
对啊。

577
00:26:37.000 --> 00:26:38.980
We had a fan question from Sophie F.
我们收到了一个来自索菲·F的粉丝提问。

578
00:26:39.160 --> 00:26:42.460
Did you get to go on the rides while you weren't filming?
你在不拍戏的时候有机会去玩游乐设施吗？

579
00:26:43.160 --> 00:26:43.680
No.
没有。

580
00:26:43.880 --> 00:26:52.740
For insurance purposes, they were not going to let cast members who were not scripted to be on the Ferris wheel get on the Ferris wheel.
出于保险考虑，剧组是绝对不会让剧本里没安排坐摩天轮的演员去坐摩天轮的。

581
00:26:53.340 --> 00:26:55.340
They wanted me nowhere near that thing.
他们才不想让我靠近那个东西半步。

582
00:26:55.340 --> 00:26:58.260
They were like, hey, big pregnant lady, you're already freaking us out.
他们就像在说，嘿，挺着大肚子的女士，你已经把我们吓坏了。

583
00:26:58.520 --> 00:26:59.120
Stay away.
离远点。

584
00:26:59.560 --> 00:27:01.780
I remember talking to Jen Salata about it.
我记得跟詹·萨拉塔聊过这事。

585
00:27:01.880 --> 00:27:05.100
And she said, oh my gosh, all the riders were like so excited.
她说，哦天哪，所有的游客都兴奋得不得了。

586
00:27:05.240 --> 00:27:07.060
They're like, we're going to ride the Ferris wheel.
他们说，我们要去坐摩天轮啦。

587
00:27:07.220 --> 00:27:08.240
It's going to be so fun.
那一定太好玩了。

588
00:27:08.520 --> 00:27:10.500
And then none of them ever rode it.
然后结果他们根本没人去坐。

589
00:27:10.840 --> 00:27:11.200
No.
没有。

590
00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:13.180
I remember when they had the bouncy houses.
我记得他们弄充气城堡的时候。

591
00:27:13.380 --> 00:27:17.440
Whenever we had a bouncy house, you know, there'd be someone be like, oh, could the kids come by today?
每当有充气城堡，总会有人问，哦，今天能让小孩子们过来玩吗？

592
00:27:17.560 --> 00:27:18.100
They're like, nope.
他们就说，不行。

593
00:27:19.000 --> 00:27:20.420
No one get on those things.
谁都不准上去玩。

594
00:27:20.880 --> 00:27:23.400
Well, two people who were allowed to get on the Ferris wheel.
不过，有两个人是被允许坐摩天轮的。

595
00:27:23.720 --> 00:27:26.520
I remember when they shot this, Angela, these poor guys.
安吉拉，我记得他们拍这一段的时候，那些小伙子真可怜。

596
00:27:26.660 --> 00:27:28.800
Do you know how many times they had to go around that Ferris wheel?
你知道他们坐那个摩天轮转了多少圈吗？

597
00:27:29.040 --> 00:27:34.440
Just as a person who rode the Jurassic Park ride for 12 hours, you know how old it gets.
作为一个坐过12小时侏罗纪公园游乐设施的人，你知道这有多烦人。

598
00:27:34.440 --> 00:27:36.160
It's a trigger for you.
这成了你的应激源。

599
00:27:36.240 --> 00:27:36.560
It is.
确实是的。

600
00:27:36.740 --> 00:27:37.000
It's a trigger.
这就是个应激源。

601
00:27:37.200 --> 00:27:39.980
And I watched them ride that Ferris wheel for about an hour.
我看着他们坐那个摩天轮坐了大约一个小时。

602
00:27:40.180 --> 00:27:42.600
I don't understand how they weren't completely sick.
我不明白他们怎么一点都不觉得恶心。

603
00:27:42.800 --> 00:27:47.900
When you watch the episode, you see one scene between Michael and Holly on the Ferris wheel, but there are more.
当你观看这集时，你会看到迈克尔和霍莉在摩天轮上的一个场景，但其实还有更多。

604
00:27:48.080 --> 00:27:50.680
And they're in the deleted scenes, and they're really cute.
它们在删减片段里，而且非常可爱。

605
00:27:50.680 --> 00:27:52.340
So they were in there for a while.
所以他们在里面待了一会儿。

606
00:27:52.740 --> 00:27:54.000
Yeah, I remember that.
对，我记得那个。

607
00:27:54.400 --> 00:27:59.060
One of the Ferris wheel scenes that I love is Michael is telling Holly a story.
我非常喜欢的其中一个摩天轮场景是迈克尔在给霍莉讲故事。

608
00:27:59.320 --> 00:28:03.840
And right as they get to the top of the Ferris wheel, she shakes the cart, like kind of leans forward.
就在他们到达摩天轮顶端时，她晃动了车厢，就像是身体前倾了一下。

609
00:28:03.840 --> 00:28:04.580
So it rocks.
所以车厢晃动了。

610
00:28:04.720 --> 00:28:06.060
And he goes, oh, my God.
然后他喊道，哦，天哪。

611
00:28:06.340 --> 00:28:08.020
And then they both start laughing.
接着他们两个都笑了起来。

612
00:28:08.020 --> 00:28:09.180
And he's like, you got me.
他说，你把我整蛊了。

613
00:28:09.300 --> 00:28:11.040
You know, it's so cute.
你知道，这太可爱了。

614
00:28:11.300 --> 00:28:12.960
It's like something Michael would have done.
就像是迈克尔会做的事。

615
00:28:13.200 --> 00:28:13.460
Yes.
是的。

616
00:28:13.680 --> 00:28:16.060
That probably would annoy anyone else.
那换作别人可能会觉得很烦。

617
00:28:16.280 --> 00:28:16.660
Yeah.
对。

618
00:28:16.900 --> 00:28:18.540
Because that's an annoying thing to do.
因为那是一种很烦人的行为。

619
00:28:18.740 --> 00:28:19.440
It really is.
确实是这样。

620
00:28:19.780 --> 00:28:20.080
Yeah.
是的。

621
00:28:20.320 --> 00:28:22.220
And he's delighted by it.
而他却为此感到高兴。

622
00:28:22.540 --> 00:28:23.220
So cute.
太可爱了。

623
00:28:23.520 --> 00:28:30.760
